0.014326621,0.00006898609,-0.015939657,0.028416963,-0.05283792,0.050270718,0.044063874,-0.0012813593,0.04699074,0.06551813,0.06679396,0.055197634,-0.013381394,0.019759081,-0.009092683,0.041352924,-0.014531617,-0.0698497,-0.028615607,0.047277927,-0.017119555,-0.045238666,0.013383756,0.021518275,-0.008153504,0.032743048,-0.0029263012,-0.06422481,-0.087831676,0.0035879267,0.03810169,-0.003542356,0.012559189,0.08494641,-0.0030564046,0.07544198,-0.018072197,-0.054589517,-0.011066199,-0.006320764,-0.040834885,0.016901223,0.024715941,0.0053821173,-0.00395019,0.00071016507,-0.054405797,-0.03570746,-0.021894166,0.002616229,-0.02714583,0.0013860344,-0.07353009,-0.013686621,0.024467124,-0.01774241,-0.023374522,-0.0140657555,0.056776665,-0.0413311,0.021146325,-0.04111056,-0.007667412,-0.021043178,0.01193909,-0.04848041,-0.036492873,-0.039408375,-0.030034028,-0.040007077,0.06021074,-0.057398304,0.0063356035,-0.008711625,0.029769639,-0.00025149412,-0.043834705,0.036965378,0.0147679765,0.010255135,0.028927544,-0.07441682,0.015980748,0.034456022,-0.00003150909,-0.05061939,-0.0069063595,-0.0007559932,-0.02668811,0.010700049,-0.044434477,-0.010695684,0.06241193,0.024259401,0.012137707,-0.008571096,-0.0054939515,-0.057982586,-0.022793911,-0.039316233,0.03446749,0.01694852,-0.008872624,-0.014856289,-0.01343074,-0.012051113,0.031345617,-0.0022129396,-0.019102348,0.021203924,-0.037296437,-0.05030161,0.005856521,0.040725634,0.016974863,-0.007732318,0.025004564,0.12374158,0.026570657,0.033055436,-0.051848814,0.03764263,0.014202052,-0.009317854,-0.030958885,-0.013338235,-0.024714496],"hash":"f318ea42:1941","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## Consolidated Summary (updated 2026-11-16T01:51:50.358Z)\n- **Built/changed**\n  - Consolidated logging in `gg_bypass2.log`; removed `byp_packets.log` and per-hit hex dumps.\n  - Standardized C2S decryption on `SimpleModulusCipher::Decrypt`; removed `NativeDecrypt`, retained `NativeEncrypt` for self-tests.\n  - Refactored logger/config setup, restored `LogStackTrace`, and added `LogPacketDual` in `src/PacketSniffer.cpp`.\n  - Added `references/11-log-analysis.md` and `byp/docs/stack_c1_07_19/`; updated `SKILL.md`, `03-crypto.md`, `07-build-deploy.md`, and `08-config.md`.\n\n- **Key decisions/findings**\n  - XorData is one chained operation for all packets: bytes `[3, len)` are XORed with the previous byte and the 32-byte `m_XorFilter`; it is self-inverse.\n  - The XOR logic remains centralized in `PacketSniffer.cpp` (`GameServerXorData`), used by normal C1 and skill injection paths; exposing it publicly was proposed but not confirmed as implemented.\n  - Skill wire is one byte, `C3`; `E7` is `MAIN_PACKET_SERIAL` before SM encryption.\n  - `InjectC1Attack` handles `0x11`/`0x19` via XorData + Layer-1, producing pure C1.\n  - `InjectSkillC1` currently handles only `0x19` via XorData + SM + C3 wrapper + Layer-1, producing `C3 0D [11]`.\n  - Capture analysis suggests skills should also use pure C1, but `AttackModule.cpp:207` still calls `InjectSkillC1`.\n\n- **Current state**\n  - Build succeeded: `byp/dist/byp.dll`.\n  - Manual deployment to `F:\\blackrockmu\\` is pending because the game is running.\n  - Breakpoint is set at `0x404E34`; `[SKILLHOOK]` logging is prepared.\n\n- **Open threads**\n  - Decide whether to replace `InjectSkillC1` with `InjectC1Attack`.\n  - Verify skill-cast values (`flag=1`, `wireId=0xE7C3`, or `flag=0`).\n  - Capture `0x59C725` and `0x404E34`; analyze `Main.dll` function `0x67D68330`.\n  - Reduce verbose `[SM] DecryptBlock` output.\n  - Validate XorData behavior for future packet types.","vector":[0.045212742,0.0040319697,-0.1703103,-0.070080206,0.0663848,-0.08273002,0.07999557,0.01880828,-0.012889837,-0.04478695,-0.06285094,0.05245232,0.039289568,-0.050422903,-0.009845787,-0.054722615,-0.036270034,-0.02206567,-0.00026599,0.01659715,0.013050247,-0.056138173,0.005103102,-0.049663946,0.11342361,0.05960