4,0.0044355094,0.01644771,-0.014332838,0.06759579,0.013442166,-0.029874198,-0.02415781,0.008599215,-0.023970256,0.043199867,0.030754637,0.013263943,-0.00026094163,0.011779659,-0.042724352,-0.044436704,-0.015263267,-0.01131802,-0.03655444,-0.009983455,-0.019541461,0.01768036,0.016817419,0.000929455,-0.009843803,-0.02210936,0.035515916,-0.030384215,0.008569776,-0.029240975,0.013252064,-0.023103395,0.025793262,-0.02058315,-0.039866515,-0.012431355,-0.028058466,-0.029233264,0.0055036373,-0.026674798,0.0034490405,-0.009254823,0.037086844,-0.0050814366,-0.02426419,0.022230314,0.0075694746,0.016061995,-0.026112182,-0.074777715,0.035976928,0.023352612,0.0010482845,0.038404513,-0.00274192,0.0014211801,-0.008485635,-0.0009971311,-0.04832374,-0.028476527,0.011700642,0.007783214,-0.0053478554,-0.00446007,-0.018362386,-0.060578525,-0.031098062,-0.084695384,0.01896356,-0.03006623,-0.015877692,-0.034800097,0.0069979825,-0.01979642,0.023686318,0.005398475,-0.024254441,0.08499286,-0.039945483,-0.025902288,-0.025052803,-0.022085978,-0.01100597,0.016406579,0.019671015,0.14559944,-0.00045094738,0.03627289,-0.013463077,0.039033294,0.014846061,-0.05589919,-0.053728726,-0.012736055,-0.027106365],"hash":"4b42555f:1919","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":false},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-15T20:59:16.156Z\n- **User:** quero um plano para organizar as coisas agora que funcionou, to vendo mta coisa desorganizada em relacao a software, mt classe lingui;'ao que poderia ter subclasses objetos separados para ajudar na manutencao.\n- **Outcome:** Analisei o estado atual. O problema central: **PacketSniffer.cpp (1577 linhas) é um \"god file\"** com 6 responsabilidades misturadas, e há lixo morto. Aqui está o plano, em fases seguras (cada fase = 1 commit + build + teste em campo): ## Fase 0 — Limpeza (risco zero) - Apagar `src/PacketSniffer.cpp.new` (231 linhas, **não está no build** — build.bat:25 lista os .cpp e ele não aparece) - Corrigir comentários obsoletos: `AttackModule.h:34` ainda diz \"0xEFF5 ... ataques normais **E skill**\" (errado desde o fix do 0x19) ## Fase 1 — Extrair a criptografia (maior valor) Criar `src/MuCipher.h/.cpp` com **tudo que é cifra**, num lugar só: - `GameServerXorData` (o helper único de XOR que você pediu no turno anterior — sai de `static` e vira `MuCipher::XorData`, visível para qualquer módulo) - `GameServerEncryptLayer1` / `GameServerDecryptLayer1` / `FullEncrypt` / `FullDecrypt` - `GetGameServerKeys` + `GetMuHeaderSize` - `SimpleModulusCipher` já é classe separada — fica como está Resultado: qualquer pacote novo chama `MuCipher::XorData(buf, 3, len)` e decide C1 ou SM→C3. ## Fase 2 — Desmontar o god file PacketSniffer | Novo arquivo | Conteúdo (linhas atuais) | |---|---| | `WinsockHooks.cpp` | trampolines, `InstallInlineHook`, `HookSend/Recv/WSA*/Connect`, `Install/Uninstall` (~687–1140) | | `PacketReassembler.cpp` | buffers por socket, `ReadMuPacketLength`, `FlushReasmBuffer` (~502–600) | | `ControlSocket.cpp` | socket TCP do MuProxy2, threads connect/recv, `SendLine` (~57–330) — confe…\n- **Tools:** list_directory, run_command, lsp, search_files, read_file, glob","vector":[0.027943024,0.0602194,-0.15460451,-0.05080799,0.0448055,-0.06928835,0.0035185488,-0.0083435755,-0.09131997,-0.03104606,-0.0524469,-0.02447164,0.06454212,0.0030628575,0.024315542,-0.01444109,-0.022146434,-0.021792928,-0.103224866,0.012686093,0.05016331,-0.041941993,0.009935058,-0.009490581,0.09337641,0.06041027,0.008574517,-0.0014107836,-0.052124858,-0.016343264,0.062307935,0.03669839,0.014819091,-0.048133533,-0.025223091,-0.06746757,0.043995995,-0.0385471,-0.0070020645,-0.03409987,-0.0072270734,-0.0619358,-0.009826406,-0.040314607,0.02235086,0.029801922,0.05051478,0.030176513,0.025361205,-0.09318985,0.046594113,0.02079234,-0.016209751,-0.050998993,0.068025656,0.030461503,-0.021719873,0.031713612,0.038262658,-0.04107288,0.08675023,0.042766985,-0.01832642,0.06919137,-0.023894198,-0.006367