dChannel`/`PacketChannel` e o tráfego interno sai do hook via `OriginalApi` (o spam de `CONNECT` sumiu). | | §3 | `GameServerDecryptLayer1`/`GameServerXorData`/`GameServerFullDecrypt` → `MuCipher::{Encrypt,Decrypt,FullEncrypt,FullDecrypt,XorData}`. | | §4 | `InjectC1Attack`/`InjectToServer`/`EnqueueSkillPacket` → `PacketInjector::Inject`/`InjectXorData` (fila removida). | | §4 (skill 0x19) | **O ponto mais grave**: a skill ainda ensinava o layout *intercalado* (`[idxH][skillH][idxL][skillL]`), `target ^ 0xEFF5` e byte de direção — leitura que o próprio `byp/docs/skill_c1_07_19_fix/` corrigiu em 2026-11-15. Hoje: skill **primeiro**, index **puro**, sem direção. O `0xEFF5` não é aplicado em opcode nenhum. | | §6 | `INJECT_PACKET` não existe mais; faltavam as 5 tags de debug (`ATTACK_HEXDUMP/SCANVALUE/SCANSLOT/DIRSCAN`). | | §10 | Todos os caminhos apontavam para a árvore plana antiga. | ## O que foi incluído agora - **§12 nova** — *module map*: árvore `src/` por domínio, tabela \"quem é dono do quê\", 6 regras de layout e …\n- **Tools:** list_directory, glob, read_file, search_files, manage_todos, write_file, edit_file, git, run_command, memory","vector":[0.009587086,0.061058518,-0.13681634,-0.055273943,0.08993272,-0.0570187,0.02507724,0.004363429,-0.045943253,-0.022981187,-0.055560615,0.0070364005,0.06858223,-0.01101038,0.020696918,-0.006378469,-0.036369033,-0.051090866,-0.037333388,0.0064576636,0.018417984,-0.036394063,-0.039659612,0.019291917,0.091214456,0.025181765,0.019529045,0.018812165,-0.034821607,0.016171332,0.031678483,-0.013725537,0.012385566,-0.027077548,0.015354382,-0.048031565,-0.0026761163,-0.044027206,-0.027750842,-0.020268496,-0.028059829,-0.034146737,-0.015523564,-0.03396939,0.0006524235,0.04953191,0.05325516,0.021699863,0.070729755,-0.092787184,0.0042195222,0.023809578,0.02926664,-0.0466983,0.104801185,0.058982477,-0.046513334,0.0516974,0.017342139,-0.005421897,0.07315359,0.018073296,-0.01914513,0.055195462,0.017776588,-0.022402449,-0.05478868,0.074